jobDescription:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Fraud Alert&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;We’ve learned that scammers are impersonating Commvault team members—including HR and leadership—via email or text. These bad actors may conduct fake interviews and ask for personal information, such as your social security number. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to know:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Commvault does&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;not&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;conduct interviews by email or text.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;We will never ask you to submit sensitive documents (including banking information, SSN, etc) before your first day.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;If you suspect a recruiting scam, please contact us at &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:wwrecruitingteam@commvault.com&quot;&gt;wwrecruitingteam@commvault.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Commvault&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Commvault (NASDAQ: CVLT) is the gold standard in cyber resilience. The company empowers customers to uncover, take action, and rapidly recover from cyberattacks – keeping data safe and businesses resilient. The company’s unique AI-powered platform combines best-in-class data protection, exceptional data security, advanced data intelligence, and lightning-fast recovery across any workload or cloud at the lowest TCO. For over 25 years, more than 100,000 organizations and a vast partner ecosystem have relied on Commvault to reduce risks, improve governance, and do more with data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Commvault is a worldwide leader in delivering backup and recovery for the progressive enterprise. Commvault enables you to protect, manage, and use your data, while managing it in a consistent, compliant way. Our automated solutions work on-prem and in the cloud, and work with the digital tools and procedures you’re already using. Keep your data accessible and actionable with a single solution that ensures your data is always available — no matter what.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position

RESPONSIBILITIES:
&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;This role will be to remotely support various Sales Engineering Managers and Sales Engineers in the US market with pre-sales/sales engagements, primarily focussed on POC’s and Demos and support other pre-sales activities such as documentation, TODs, ALDs, RFI/RFPs, discovery&amp;amp; requirement gathering, technical research etc.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Position Requirements:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;5+ years of hands-on experience in Technical Support and/or experience in data recovery, backup &amp;amp; recovery solutions with a focus on any one or more Cloud platforms such as Azure, AWS and GCP. Strong understanding of technology &amp;amp; cybersecurity basics, computer networking fundamentals, OSI layers, OSI layer protocols, Active directory&amp;amp; DNS basics, TCP, UDP etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Hands-on Configuration &amp;amp; troubleshooting level Knowledge on:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;Networking, Storage Systems, Hypervisors and container solutions such as VMware, Hyper-V, Nutanix AHV, Kubernetes, Open Stack, Open Shift etc.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;Cloud Platforms such as Azure and AWS (Saa S/Paa S/Iaa S Infra exposure)&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;Databases such as MSSQL, MYSQL, Oracle, SAP, Postgre SQL, Mongo DB, etc&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Prior experience in Customer facing role to demonstrate, delivering a pilot / POC, Technical Demos of cybersecurity solutions with strong interpersonal skills. [For AMER COE hires: Prior experience with US based Customers is preferred &amp;amp; flexibility to work in permanent night shifts].&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills (English) both written and verbal. Proficient in building &amp;amp; articulating Power Point presentations.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Good to have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;o Proficiency in on-boarding CRM apps like Salesforce, D365 etc.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;o Prior Hands-on exposure on Commvault/ Rubrik/ Veeam/Cohesity, Dell, Net App, Pure Storage Technologies.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;o Relevant Industry certification(s) in cloud (AWS, Azure etc) &amp;amp; AI.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;o Additional languages spoken like French, German, Spanish etc.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;jd-info au-target&quot; data-ph-at-id=&quot;jobdescription-text&quot; data-ph-id=&quot;ph-page-element-page5-4e8TMw&quot;&gt; &lt;p&gt;Commvault is an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. We are always committed to equal employment opportunity regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity or Veteran status and we will not discriminate against on the basis of such characteristics or any other status protected by the laws or regulations in the locations where we work.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Commvault’s goal is to make interviewing inclusive and accessible to all candidates and employees. If you have a disability or special need that requires accommodation to participate in the interview process or apply for a position at Commvault, please email &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accommodations@commvault.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;WHY2&quot;&gt;accommodations@commvault.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;For any inquiries not related to an accommodation please reach out to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:wwrecruitingteam@commvault.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;WHY2&quot;&gt;wwrecruitingteam@commvault.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.commvault.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Commvault&#39;s Privacy Policy &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Fraud Alert&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;We’ve learned that scammers are impersonating Commvault team members—including HR and leadership—via email or text. These bad actors may conduct fake interviews and ask for personal information, such as your social security number. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to know:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Commvault does&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;not&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;conduct interviews by email or text.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;We will never ask you to submit sensitive documents (including banking information, SSN, etc) before your first day.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;If you suspect a recruiting scam, please contact us at &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:wwrecruitingteam@commvault.com&quot;&gt;wwrecruitingteam@commvault.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Commvault&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Commvault (NASDAQ: CVLT) is the gold standard in cyber resilience. The company empowers customers to uncover, take action, and rapidly recover from cyberattacks – keeping data safe and businesses resilient. The company’s unique AI-powered platform combines best-in-class data protection, exceptional data security, advanced data intelligence, and lightning-fast recovery across any workload or cloud at the lowest TCO. For over 25 years, more than 100,000 organizations and a vast partner ecosystem have relied on Commvault to reduce risks, improve governance, and do more with data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Security Architect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly skilled &lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Security Architect&lt;/strong&gt; to lead the design and evaluation of secure software architectures across a diverse range of systems and applications. The ideal candidate will have deep expertise in security architecture review and threat modeling, with a strong understanding of modern software development practices and security best practices. Experience with automated tools for security architecture analysis and relevant security certifications is strongly preferred.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Conduct in-depth security architecture reviews across cloud, on-premises, and hybrid environments.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Perform threat modeling to identify potential security risks and define mitigation strategies early in the development of lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Work closely with development teams, Dev Ops, and product owners to design secure systems and guide secure software design decisions.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Evaluate and implement automated tools to support architecture reviews and continuous security assessments.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Create and maintain security architecture documentation and reusable patterns.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Provide expert guidance on security controls, design patterns, and industry best practices.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development and improvement of internal security standards, frameworks, and processes.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Stay current on emerging threats, vulnerabilities, and regulatory requirements&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in application or software security architecture.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of threat modeling methodologies (e.g., STRIDE, PASTA, OCTAVE).&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience conducting security architecture reviews for complex systems.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Familiarity with automated security architecture tools (e.g., Irius Risk, Threat Modeler, Microsoft Threat Modeling Tool, or similar).&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience in reviewing architecture Gen AI solutions&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of secure coding practices, software development lifecycle (SDLC), and Dev Sec Ops integration.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills to collaborate with both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;

PREFERRED

QUALIFICATIONS:

&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Relevant certifications such as CSSLP, CISSP, SABSA, TOGAF, or GICSP.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience in regulated environments (e.g., finance, healthcare, or critical infrastructure).&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Familiarity with cloud platforms (AWS, Azure, GCP) and associated security architectures.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience working in Agile or CI/CD environments.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll love working here because...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Continuous professional development, product training, and career pathing&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Annual health check-ups, Tuition Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;An inclusive company culture, an opportunity to join our Community Guilds&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Personal accident cover and Term life cover&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;Ready to #makeyourmark at Commvault? Apply now!&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;#LI-RK1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;jd-info au-target&quot; data-ph-at-id=&quot;jobdescription-text&quot; data-ph-id=&quot;ph-page-element-page5-4e8TMw&quot;&gt; &lt;p&gt;Commvault is an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. We are always committed to equal employment opportunity regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity or Veteran status and we will not discriminate against on the basis of such characteristics or any other status protected by the laws or regulations in the locations where we work.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Commvault’s goal is to make interviewing inclusive and accessible to all candidates and employees. If you have a disability or special need that requires accommodation to participate in the interview process or apply for a position at Commvault, please email &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accommodations@commvault.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt